@baseUrl = https://license-server.example.invalid
@accessToken = REPLACE_WITH_CLIENT_API_ACCESS_TOKEN
@organizationId = 11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111
@alias = client-iam

# Examples only. No bridge/provider is contacted by GET endpoints.
# Requires authenticated CiemApiAccess and active organization account binding.

### Refresh safe server alias status and per-category source coverage (200)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/organizations/{{organizationId}}/continuous-change-feeds
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Explicit enable and connect (200; ManageConnections + ManagePolicies)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/organizations/{{organizationId}}/continuous-change-feeds/{{alias}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"enabled":true,"connected":true,"resetSource":false}

### Explicit source replacement/backfill epoch reset (200; old evidence retained)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/organizations/{{organizationId}}/continuous-change-feeds/{{alias}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"enabled":true,"connected":true,"resetSource":true}

### Pause worker and fence in-flight attempts (204)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/organizations/{{organizationId}}/continuous-change-feeds/{{alias}}/pause
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Read latest 100 saved immutable normalized revisions across epochs (200)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/organizations/{{organizationId}}/continuous-change-feeds/{{alias}}/changes?limit=100
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Out-of-bounds limit (400)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/organizations/{{organizationId}}/continuous-change-feeds/{{alias}}/changes?limit=501
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Unconfigured server alias cannot be connected (400)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/organizations/{{organizationId}}/continuous-change-feeds/missing-alias
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"enabled":true,"connected":true,"resetSource":false}
